{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10214","headline":"酬皇甫十六侍御曾见寄 · 李嘉佑","name":"酬皇甫十六侍御曾见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自顾衰容累玉除，忽承优诏赴铜鱼。\n江头鸟避青旄节，城里人迎露网车。\n长沙地近悲才子，古郡山多忆旧庐。\n更枉新诗思何苦，离骚愁处亦无如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}